      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so heavy. honestly i'm just so tired of fighting for a version of me that doesn't even exist. it feels like i'm just dragging around this broken shell of a person. and the more i try, the more i realize it's just... it's futile. sometimes i look at everything and just think, wouldn't it be more peaceful if it just stopped? if i didn't have to keep trying to \"be\" something?",
